	(text "1.  PWR(7): Controller power supply (input). ※Pink\n2.  REV_SW(14): Reverse switch input. ※Orange\n3.  GND(6): Signal return or power supply return. ※Black\n4.  FWD(12): Forward switch or can be enabled as High speed switch function. ※White\n5.  Throttle(3): Throttle analog input, 0-5V. ※ Green \n6.  Foot_SW(15): Throttle switch input. ※Gray \n7.  12V(11): 12V Supply. ※Red\n8.  12V (25): brake switch. ※Yellowish\n9.  ECO(22): Low speed switch. ※Blue\n10. CAN-H(33): (Optional function). ※Greenish\n11. CAN-L(34): (Optional function). ※Brownish\n12. GND(20): Signal return. ※Black\n13. 5V(4): 5V Supply, <40mA. ※Purple\n14. Brake_AN(2): Brake variable regen or Boost function. ※Brown\n15. 12V(11): 12V Supply. ※Red\n16. GND(21): Signal return. ※Black\n16. Meter(8): Copied signal of hall-A sensor. ※Dark Gray\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 262.636 0)
		(effects
